            {
              "content": "Analyze the user's question and determine if it's:\n1. A \"metadata query\" - asking for counts, lists, or filtering (e.g., \"how many blogs about React?\", \"list all Angular articles\")\n2. A \"content query\" - asking about information within articles (e.g., \"what are React best practices?\")\n\nRespond with ONLY one word: \"metadata\" or \"content\"",
